{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04929","headline":"奉和幸安乐公主山庄应制 · 卢藏用","name":"奉和幸安乐公主山庄应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"皇女璚台天汉浔，星桥月宇构山林。\n飞萝半拂银题影，瀑布环流玉砌阴。\n菊浦香随鹦鹉泛，箫楼韵逐凤凰吟。\n瑶池驻跸恩方久，璧月无文兴转深。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢藏用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04929.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04929","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}